<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalRefType/mavenCentral> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A reference to a Maven repository artifact. The artifact locator format is defined in the [Maven documentation](https://maven.apache.org/guides/mini/guide-naming-conventions.html) and looks like `groupId:artifactId[:version]`."@en .
